###getAlbumes No existente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/Albumes/4

###nuevoAlbum
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/Albumes
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "nombre": "Totenlider"
    "anio": 2005,
    "banda": "Absurd",
    "genero": "Black Metal",
    "precio": 14.80
}

###nuevoAlbum
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/Albumes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Totenlider",
    "anio": 2005,
    "banda": "Absurd",
    "genero": "Black Metal",
    "precio": 14.80
}


